{"id":"vod_sn_38530","vodId":"38530","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"欢迎来到实力至上主义教室","name_cn":"欢迎来到实力至上主义教室","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/e9c67afb8a57e7a1b0f3f01f31f0591c.jpg"},"summary":"这个社会是否平等呢。真正的“实力”是什么？　　东京都高度育成高等学校。那是宣扬彻底的实力至上主义，以升学率·就业率100%而引以为豪的升学学校。升入那里，被分配到1年D班的绫小路清隆，却发现学校与实力至上主义的招牌相反，学生每个月会得到相当于10万日元、与现金同等价值的分数，在授课和生活态度方面也贯彻放任主义。在梦幻般的高中生活当中，不断地挥金如土、过着自甘堕落日子的同班同学们。但，不久他就得知了学校系统的真面目，并被打入绝望的深渊……！　　来自吊车尾聚集的D班的少年少女们所发现的，是世界的矛盾，还是正当的实力社会？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:02:23","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aeNiz4Hez11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TUp6eTLZ051/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XxbL9UHy5T1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/C5mviQZZvD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BrfcZcrHcC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ke2DNdA48M1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/U4m7PzjrJm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pnh1VE0zPD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JZGwFHtXz51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RFqhRznTRM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/btuc3nPiBu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Vxqps7WMc11/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:57.768Z"}